  "abstract": "Best LN base with a tiny prior encouraging \u03b3[t] to follow its linear schedule (stabilize late-horizon scaling). Keep MAE+curvature (\u03bb=1e-4) and V-OrthoReg (\u03bb_V=1e-5).",
